+# =========================================================================
+# RUNTIME-TUNABLE THROTTLE PARAMETERS  [bd-dre-i4qoy]
+# =========================================================================
+# ⛔ WHY THIS EXISTS. Every knob below used to be `int(os.environ.get(...))` at
+# IMPORT. Retuning one therefore meant relaunching the Hermes sessions that had
