+# Tonight that turned a one-number fix into a "needs a relaunch" item.
+#
+# Resolution order, evaluated on EVERY use (first hit wins):
+#     1. environment variable   — a launch-time pin; still wins, as before
+#     2. ~/.hermes/pool-broker.json  "throttle": {"<key>": <value>}
+#     3. the module constant below — the documented default, and the attribute a
+#        test monkeypatches
+# A malformed value falls through to the default rather than raising: nothing on
+# this path may fail a dispatch.
+#
+# The config keys are documented in pool-broker.json's own `_throttle_comment`,
+# so the next person retuning does not have to read this module to find them.
+_TUNABLE_SPEC: Dict[str, tuple] = {
